{
  "$schema": "termix-hire-lifecycle/v1",
  "whatThisIs": "The on-chain lifecycle of every ERC-8183 hire in this report, recovered from BNB Chain testnet after the fact because the hire artefacts did not record it. It supplies the four transaction hashes per hire that protocol s3.2 requires, and it replaces E1's polled delivery latency with a latency derived from block timestamps.",
