    "fixedAndPublished": true,
    "fromBlockUtc": "2026-09-06T05:20:13Z",
    "toBlockUtc": "2026-09-06T10:57:44Z",
    "why": "Fixed constants in the script, not `latest`, so the scan is reproducible. The window opens about 10 minutes before the first job was created and closes about 6 hours after the last one, which is what makes 'jobs 1032 and 1038 were never submitted' a statement about the chain rather than about when we stopped looking."
  },
